      "headline": "BISP and Ehsaas Difference Explained: History, 8171 Portal, Program Mapping & Current Status (2026)",
      "description": "BISP and Ehsaas difference explained: BISP Act 2010 vs Ehsaas policy framework, 8171 portal transition, program-by-program name changes, and current 2026 status.",
